  "description": "The Elite Bandit 24” is built for riders who want BMX control with a little more stretch and speed. Rocking a full hi-tensile steel frame, the Bandit blends classic BMX toughness with cruiser-style flow—perfect for street sessions, pump tracks, manuals, and long neighborhood laps.\n\nFinished off with a simple, reliable V-brake setup, the Bandit stays lightweight for its size at just 28.8 lbs, making it easy to throw around despite the bigger wheels.\n\nWhether you’re leveling up from a 20”, cruising with style, or just want that BMX feel with extra stability, the Elite Bandit 24” delivers raw BMX DNA with grown-up proportions.",
